From f0a07464b24d479a0f10a57d46089c66dd7979f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 17:26:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] commit 4: Add CommandType mapping table

- Implement command name to type classification using Redis dict
- Use case-insensitive hash (dictSdsCaseHash/dictSdsKeyCaseCompare)
  so lookups work with any case (SET/set/Set all work)
- Cover all 22 categories: string, hash, list, set, sorted-set,
  bitmap, hyperloglog, geo, stream, pubsub, scripting,
  transactions, connection, server, generic, cluster,
  bf, cf, json, search, timeseries, topk
- Unknown commands return 'undefined'
- Initialize dict in initServer() via auditCommandTypeInit()
---
 src/audit.c  | 418 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/audit.h  |   4 +
 src/server.c |   3 +-
 3 files changed, 424 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

